    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Built for you\nA person uploads one quotation PDF. **Read the PDF text** turns it into text, and **Policy limits** adds the limits from the Procurement Policy (v3.0) so later steps can use them.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "16bb0d12-e74d-5df3-b175-e8a81ce49eb6",
      "name": "Note: built",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Check the quotation\nAdd an AI node here (**Basic LLM Chain** or **AI Agent**) and connect it to **Policy limits**. Use your Quotation Checker instructions from Module 03. Ask it to reply in JSON with: supplier, total_incl_tax, valid_until, advance_percent, problems (with clause numbers) and verdict (pass, revise, reject or escalate).",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e2299195-7328-53f8-a422-4dd3404d5b3b",
      "name": "Note: step1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 2: Check the supplier\nLook the supplier up in `approved-vendors.csv` (a Google Sheet, or a Code node with the list pasted in). Not on the list means **reject**, whatever the AI said.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "812c200c-1fa2-5194-8e75-89d5d2713447",
      "name": "Note: step2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1180,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 3: Route it\nAdd a **Switch** node on the verdict: pass goes to approval, revise drafts an email to the supplier, reject is logged, escalate goes to the Finance Director.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "6b3cef5e-7cc2-57e9-9a55-0b47c139f407",
      "name": "Note: step3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1620,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 4: A person approves\nUse a **Send and Wait for Response** step (Gmail or Outlook) so the Head of Procurement approves or rejects before anything is sent. Nothing reaches a supplier without a person's approval.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "98f41140-a654-5d3e-835e-9b6837162ae9",
      "name": "Note: step4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2060,
        -220
      ]
    }
